<title>DUBAI: SOCCER-IRAN BEAT SOUTH KOREA 6-2 IN ASIAN CUP QUARTER-FINALS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-IRAN BEAT SOUTH KOREA 6-2 IN ASIAN CUP QUARTER-FINALS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran beat South Korea 6-2 (halftime</p>
<p>1-2) in an Asian Cup quarter-final tie on Monday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Iran: Karim Bagheri 30, Khodadad Azizi 51, Ali Daei 66, 76,</p>
<p>83, 88 pen</p>
<p>South Korea: Kim Do Hoon 11, Sin Tae Yong 34</p>
<p>Attendence: 10,000</p>
</text>
